  aciklama:
  - "Orta k\u0131s\u0131mlarda yo\u011Funla\u015Fan telve \xF6beklerinde, yapraklar\u0131
    topra\u011Fa bakan bir \xE7i\xE7ek fig\xFCr\xFC ilgimi \xE7ekti {{isim}}. \U0001F940\xDCst\xFCnde
    durdu\u011Fu topra\u011Fa tutunam\u0131yor gibi g\xF6r\xFCnen bu \xE7i\xE7ek,
    filizlenip serpildi\u011Fi as\u0131l topraklardan kopar\u0131lm\u0131\u015F gibi.\n\nGeorge
    Washington'\u0131n \u015Fu s\xF6z\xFC, asl\u0131nda bu a\xE7\u0131l\u0131m\u0131
    \xF6zetler nitelikte: \"K\xF6k almaya ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda h\u0131zla
    b\xFCy\xFCyen bir bitki gibidir \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFCk.\" \U0001F5FD Demem o ki, yak\u0131n
    zamanda ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n {{data, cinsiyet=erkek, han\u0131mefendi
    | cinsiyet=kad\u0131n, beyefendi | cinsiyet=lgbt, insan}}, ili\u015Fkinizin sonland\u0131\u011F\u0131
    g\xFCnden bu yana zihnen de ruhen de senden kopamam\u0131\u015F; a\u015Fina oldu\u011Fu
    her \u015Feye adeta yabanc\u0131la\u015Fm\u0131\u015F ve sana duydu\u011Fu hislerin
    esareti alt\u0131na girmi\u015F.\n\nAyr\u0131lman\u0131n kendisine getirece\u011Fini
    sand\u0131\u011F\u0131 \"\xF6zg\xFCrl\xFCk\" hissi, san\u0131yorum ki ta\u015F\u0131yamad\u0131\u011F\u0131
    bir y\xFCk haline gelmi\u015F. Hem onun hislerini hem de kader planlar\u0131n\u0131zdaki
    olas\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131 ayn\u0131 potada eritti\u011Fimde, en fazla {{sayi,2,6}}
    hafta i\xE7inde seninle bir \u015Fekilde ileti\u015Fime ge\xE7meye \xE7al\u0131\u015Faca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    s\xF6yleyebilirim. Buna olan ihtiyac\u0131 g\xFCn ge\xE7tik\xE7e art\u0131yor.
    Her \u015Feyi eski seyrine d\xF6nd\xFCrmek isteyece\u011Finden, ad\u0131n\u0131n
    \"{{isim}}\" oldu\u011Fu kadar ve kendi ad\u0131m\u0131n da \"Magnus\" oldu\u011Fu
    kadar eminim!"
